  "prefLabel": "Plc 1603.06 Withdrawal of Application for Initial Registration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1603.06 Withdrawal of Application for Initial Registration.\n\n(a) An applicant may withdraw the application for registration at any time prior to being notified of a decision under Plc 1603.07, by proceeding in accordance with Plc 304.07.\n\n(b) If the application is withdrawn, the application processing and licensing fee shall not be refunded.\n\nSource. #13914, eff 5-6-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1600.html"
